{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36893","headline":"送裴饶归会稽 · 罗隐","name":"送裴饶归会稽","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金庭路指剡川隈，珍重良朋自此来。\n两鬓不堪悲岁月，一巵犹得话尘埃。\n家通曩分心空在，世逼横流眼未开。\n笑杀山阴雪中客，等闲乘兴又须回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36893.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36893","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}